Section 0: Initial Setup
Section 0.1: Downloading the Program
To download the program, navigate to the server and open the Code folder
Transfer “Trajectory Generators.zip” to your device
Double click on the file to unzip the folder. You may now continue to Section 0.2 to download the requirements needed to run the program
Section 0.2: Downloading the Program Requirements
In Finder (File Explorer on Windows), right click on the unzipped Trajectory Generators folder
To right click on Mac, click using 2 fingers
In the menu that opens, click on New Terminal at Folder
A terminal window should open up. Wait to see “Trajectory Generators %” before proceeding to Step 4

Type in “pip install -r requirements.txt” and press Enter. Everything should be ready to go! Proceed to Section 1 to open the program
